Date: Thu, 13 Aug 2026 16:01:30 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] feat: add degraded-account monitor to quality guard

Surface streaming TPS anomalies by account on the quality-guard page
so operators can filter repeat offenders and mute or unmute them with
the existing account batch API.

Classification matches the panel formula: output tokens over generation
time, with buffered_burst for short windows.
